        "speaker": "Trevor",
        "text": "We’re hoping to welcome a few more volunteers this year, particularly anyone who enjoys working with bicycles. You don’t have to come every month, and we can pair new people with someone experienced. The main thing is being patient and willing to share what you know. It’s not only about fixing objects. People often stay for a cup of tea and a chat, and that’s become an important part of the project too. Thank you for listening, and please come and have a look at our tools and displays afterwards."
